{"_meta":{"source":"Yahoo Finance via yfinance (profile, statements, analyst estimates)","fetched_at":"2026-10-30T16:58:15+00:00","status":"ok","error":null,"last_success":"2026-10-30T16:58:15+00:00"},"data":{"profile":{"name":"Gerresheimer AG","sector":"Healthcare","industry":"Medical Instruments & Supplies","country":"Germany","city":"Düsseldorf","website":"https://www.gerresheimer.com","employees":13301,"summary":"Gerresheimer AG, together with its subsidiaries, provides drug containment solutions in Germany and internationally. The company operates through three divisions: Plastics & Devices, Primary Packaging Glass, and Advanced Technologies. It offers prefillable syringes, plastic and glass packaging solutions, vials, glass cartridges and ampoules, bottles and containers, and containers, bottles, caps, closures, applicators, and accessories; development, industrialization, and contract manufacturing of drug delivery programs; project and quality management; and drug delivery devices, including inhalers, injection/auto injectors, and pen injectors. The company also provides diagnostic and medical devices comprising point-of-care tests, laboratory disposables, chemical and technical bottles, diagnostic and polymer vials, dropper bottles, PET bottles, and medical products comprising lancing devices, infusion sets, and disposable systems. In addition, it offers cosmetic packaging solutions, such as moulded glass flacons and jars; tubular glass ampoules, droppers, samplers and vials; and plastic packaging products, as well as pharmaceutical, laboratory, and regulatory affairs services. The company offers its products to pharmacy chains, supermarkets, and wholesalers. The company serves pharma, biotech, medical technology, diagnostics, cosmetics, glass containers, and food and beverage industries. Gerresheimer AG was founded in 1864 and is based in Düsseldorf, Germany.","exchange":"XETRA","currency":"EUR","financial_currency":"EUR","summary_fr":"Gerresheimer AG, avec ses filiales, fournit des solutions de confinement de médicaments en Allemagne et à l'international. La société opère à travers trois divisions : Plastics & Devices, Primary Packaging Glass et Advanced Technologies. Il offre des seringues préremplies, des solutions d'emballage en plastique et en verre, des flacons, des cartouches et ampoules en verre, des flacons et des contenants, des flacons, des bouchons, des bouchons, des applicateurs et des accessoires; le développement, l'industrialisation et la fabrication à contrat de programmes d'administration de médicaments; la gestion de projets et de la qualité; et les dispositifs d'administration de médicaments, y compris les inhalateurs, les injections automatiques et les stylos."},"valuation":{"market_cap_yahoo":1106661632,"shares_outstanding":34540000,"trailing_pe":null,"forward_pe":11.708773,"price_to_book":1.1570129,"ev_to_ebitda":10.166,"ev_to_revenue":1.418,"dividend_yield":0.0,"payout_ratio":0.0385,"beta_yahoo":0.448},"targets":{"current_price":32.04,"mean":27.375,"median":25.5,"high":46.0,"low":20.0,"n_analysts":12,"reco_mean":3.23077,"reco_key":"hold"},"calendar":{"earnings_dates":["2026-11-25"],"eps_avg":null,"eps_low":null,"eps_high":null,"revenue_avg":600443800,"ex_dividend":"2025-06-06","dividend_date":null},"holders":{"insiders_pct":0.11423001,"institutions_pct":0.72480005,"institutions_float_pct":0.81827,"institutions_n":122,"institutions":[{"name":"Boston Common Asset Management, LLC","pct":0.004,"shares":137775,"value":4414311,"date":"2024-12-31","chg":-0.0744}],"funds":[{"name":"VANGUARD STAR FUNDS-Vanguard Total International Stock Index Fund","pct":0.013200001,"shares":456024,"value":14611009,"date":"2026-07-31","chg":-0.061100002},{"name":"VANGUARD TAX-MANAGED FUNDS-Vanguard Developed Markets Index Fund","pct":0.0087,"shares":301585,"value":9662783,"date":"2026-06-30","chg":-0.034},{"name":"iShares Trust-iShares Core MSCI EAFE ETF","pct":0.0070999996,"shares":246166,"value":7887158,"date":"2026-